WEBVTT

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:20.620
So, Kyouno...

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.500
What're you planning to do?

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.500
Umm... I don't know?

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:32.340
Unbelievable. It's your last summer of high school.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.510
Most students have their whole career already planned out by now.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:39.640
You, on the other hand, haven't even decided whether you want to go to college or get a job.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.310
When you put it that way... I guess you're right.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.230
You guess? You know...

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:48.690
This is your future we're talking about.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.520
I know.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:53.320
In fact, I've been giving it a lot of thought.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:57.110
Yeah, right. You're not fooling anybody.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:00:58.070
Uh-oh...

00:00:58.950 --> 00:00:59.580
Well...

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:05.710
After that performance you gave us, I can't hold it against you if you feel a little burnt out.

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.670
Oh, not at all.

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:09.920
The Jersey Club is always in tip-top shape!

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:12.840
People usually retire from their club in their senior year.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:15.470
Once a Kamo Girls' Jersey Club member, always a Jersey Club member!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.810
One, two, three!

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:25.180
Two, two, three!

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:27.140
Three, two, three!

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:50.250
Career plans, eh...{da chairs are back}

